v1.0.53: Extract shared inline picker widget — performance fix for 3 modals

Refactored the collapsible inline picker pattern (AnimatedRotation chevron +
AnimatedSize + CupertinoPicker/CupertinoDatePicker + Selesai button) used
in Booking Manual, Kostum Baru, and Cicilan Baru into a single shared
widget so setState calls no longer rebuild the entire modal.

What was slow: each tap or wheel-scroll on a picker called setState on the
parent modal State. The parent rebuilds the whole ListView with all sections
(text fields, image pickers, picker rows). With 4 pickers in Booking Manual
and shared `setState` for every wheel micro-step on the date picker, this
caused visible jank on slower devices.

The fix: new core widget lib/core/widgets/inline_picker_row.dart owns the
expand/collapse State internally. The parent modal now just supplies
`items`, `selectedKey`, and `onSelected`/`onChanged` callbacks. The
`CupertinoPicker`/`CupertinoDatePicker` widget tree (heavy: 180px wheel,
scroll controllers, item children) lives inside the picker's own State, so
parent rebuilds never re-create them.

API:
  InlinePickerRow  — generic CupertinoPicker row (used for Ukuran, Kostum,
                     Keperluan). items: List<InlinePickerItem>, supports
                     subtitle, disabled state, placeholder text.
  InlineDatePickerRow — CupertinoDatePicker row (used for Tanggal Mulai,
                     Tanggal Selesai, Jatuh tempo). Supports Hapus Tanggal
                     secondary button.

Verified visually on emulator for all 3 modals:
  - Kostum Baru: Ukuran picker opens inline, S/M/L/XL/All Size/Custom shown.
  - Cicilan Baru: Jatuh tempo picker opens inline, 3 wheels month/day/year,
    Hapus Tanggal + Selesai buttons.
  - Booking Manual: 4 pickers (Kostum, Tanggal Mulai, Tanggal Selesai,
    Keperluan) all open inline, Selesai buttons.

Code impact:
  - manual_booking_modal.dart: removed 4 _isXExpanded bools, 5 helper
    methods (_togglePicker/_onStartDateChanged/_onEndDateChanged/
    _onCostumeChanged/_onPurposeChanged), 4 _build*Picker + _pickerContainer
    methods (-209 lines).
  - add_costume_sheet.dart: removed _isSizePickerExpanded state +
    _showSizePicker method, replaced size row with InlinePickerRow.
  - installment_list_screen.dart: removed isDatePickerExpanded state,
    replaced date row with InlineDatePickerRow.
  - 89/89 tests pass, flutter analyze clean.

